<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/chapter/79> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions \n\n[Open the official source PDF](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1035298c6c9802f7ed9e0/dmg-Chap-79.pdf).\n\nIndependent, unofficial demonstration. It is not a DWP publication, benefits advice, an eligibility assessment or a statement of current law.\n\nThis chapter is reproduced as page-level text records. Page numbers are PDF page positions, not printed paragraph identifiers.\n\n## Pages\n\n- [PDF page 1](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0001.md)\n- [PDF page 2](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0002.md)\n- [PDF page 3](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0003.md)\n- [PDF page 4](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0004.md)\n- [PDF page 5](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0005.md)\n- [PDF page 6](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0006.md)\n- [PDF page 7](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0007.md)\n- [PDF page 8](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0008.md)\n- [PDF page 9](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0009.md)\n- [PDF page 10](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0010.md)\n- [PDF page 11](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0011.md)\n- [PDF page 12](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0012.md)\n- [PDF page 13](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0013.md)\n- [PDF page 14](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0014.md)\n- [PDF page 15](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/