<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/chapter/83> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods\n\n[Open the official source PDF](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa9038ee5274a3e391e3e7c/dmgch83.pdf).\n\nIndependent, unofficial demonstration. It is not a DWP publication, benefits advice, an eligibility assessment or a statement of current law.\n\nThis chapter is reproduced as page-level text records. Page numbers are PDF page positions, not printed paragraph identifiers.\n\n## Pages\n\n- [PDF page 1](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0001.md)\n- [PDF page 2](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0002.md)\n- [PDF page 3](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0003.md)\n- [PDF page 4](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0004.md)\n- [PDF page 5](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0005.md)\n- [PDF page 6](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0006.md)\n- [PDF page 7](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0007.md)\n- [PDF page 8](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0008.md)\n- [PDF page 9](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0009.md)\n- [PDF page 10](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0010.md)\n- [PDF page 11](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0011.md)\n- [PDF page 12](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0012.md)\n- [PDF page 13](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0013.md)\n- [PDF page 14](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0014.md)\n- [PDF page 15](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp