<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/guide/overview> <https://schema.org/text> "# Independent Pension Credit exploration\n\nIndependent, unofficial demonstration. It is not a DWP publication, benefits advice, an eligibility assessment or a statement of current law.\n\nSource guidance may contain historical rates, dates, examples and superseded provisions. An observation date does not establish legal currency.\n\nPDF extraction preserves page boundaries but may lose tables, footnotes, reading order and formatting. Check the linked source PDF page.\n\nChapter 83 has letter-spaced PDF text that reduces search quality. Some pages have no extracted text and may contain blank space or images; inspect their PDFs.\n\nSeven substantive chapters form the default searchable corpus. Transitional, spare and amendment documents remain separately identified in the source inventory.\n\nAuthored terminology and research journeys are AI-assisted navigation aids awaiting pensions specialist review. They do not establish legal relationships or decisions.\n\n## Chapters\n\n- [DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/77.md)\n- [DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/78.md)\n- [DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/79.md)\n- [DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/83.md)\n- [DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/84.md)\n- [DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/85.md)\n- [DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/86.md)\n\n## Start with a research question\n\n- [Where does the guide explain capital disregards?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc001.md)\n- [Where are earnings and other income distinguished?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc002.md)\n- [What historical context matters for assessed income periods?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc003.md)\n- [How can I trace an extract back to the original?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc007.md)\n- [Can this bundle tell me what I am entitled to?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc008.md)\n\n[Research reference: Where does the guide explain capital disregards?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc001.md).\n\n[Research reference: Where are earnings and other income distinguished?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc002.md).\n\n[Research reference: What historical context matters for assessed income periods?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc003.md).\n\n[Research reference: How can I trace an extract back to the original?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc007.md).\n\n[Research reference: Can this bundle tell me what I am entitled to?](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/question/pc008.md)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
