<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/guide/source-scope> <https://schema.org/text> "# Source scope and change history\n\nThese records are catalogued for provenance. Their pages are not mixed into the default current-topic search corpus.\n\n- **DMG Vol 13 Ch 80: Transitional provisions** — transitional; 14 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a802f86ed915d74e33f8f3f/dmgch80.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13 Ch 81: This chapter is spare ** — spare; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7c8a72ed915d6969f45992/dmg-vol13-ch81-blank.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13 Ch 82: This chapter is spare ** — spare; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7c8c4c40f0b626628acd62/dmg-vol13-ch82-blank.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Summary of changes from December 2020** — change-history; 4 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1030420b52e4144868956/dmg-v-13-summary-of-changes.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 46, June 2020** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5ede301ad3bf7f2ca42c697e/dmg-amends-summary-june20-vol13.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 45, February 2020** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e45665840f0b677c3e37fc7/v13am45.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 44, October 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 71 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5dbad983e5274a4aa55a0a29/vol-13-amd-44-oct-2019.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 43, June 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 70 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d12009aed915d3200001b47/vol13am43.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 42, February 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 124 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5caf489fe5274a59c06bf111/vol13am42.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 41, October 2018** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 16 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5c5023c2e5274a4934b11e2e/v13am41.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 40, June 2018** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 33 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b3b52d5e5274a7018dac632/v13am40.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 39, June 2017** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 28 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a8211deed915d74e62359f3/v13am39.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 38, October 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 22 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a74dc1ee5274a3cb2867c34/v13am38.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 37, June 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 40 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a81636ced915d74e6231fcd/v13am37.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 13: Amendment 36, February 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 32 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a80a595ed915d74e33fb9d5/v13am36.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Summary of changes from December 2021** — change-history; 3 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e387730f5842e1f5a5e9c/dmg-v-14-summary-of-changes.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 51, June 2020** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5ede304c86650c74ad78ab83/dmg-amends-summary-june20-vol14.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 50, February 2020** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 1 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5e456b37ed915d4ffed119ca/vol14am50.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 49, June 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 4 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5d120102ed915d3200001b48/vol14am49.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 48, February 2019** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 18 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5caf4a57ed915d6f2acf7c36/vol14am48.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 47, October 2018** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 8 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5c50240fed915d7d42c68184/v14am47.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 46, June 2018** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 13 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5b3b532ae5274a6feb6f4614/v14am46.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 45, February 2018** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 56 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa903eeed915d4f595c58c6/v14am45.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 44, October 2017** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 18 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a82a14be5274a2e8ab5886c/v14am44.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 43, June 2017** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 60 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a74f6b9e5274a59fa716567/v14am43.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 42, February 2017** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 24 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a759277e5274a545822c8ea/v14am42.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 41, October 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 22 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a7f7083e5274a2e8ab4c309/v14am41.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 40, June 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 80 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a80780240f0b62305b8b55d/v14am40.pdf).\n- **DMG Vol 14: Amendment 39, February 2016** — historical-amendment-not-current-rules; 14 PDF pages. [Official source](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5a809aff40f0b623026947a9/v14am39.pdf)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
