<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/77/0001> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable — PDF page 1\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=1).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nDMG Chapter 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the\nhousehold and normal amount payable\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • General 77001 - 77030\n  • Conditions of entitlement 77031 - 77099\n  • Membership of the household 77100 - 77299\n  • Normal amount payable 77300 - 77999\n  • Appendix 1 - Amounts to be used in the calculation of entitlement\n  • Appendix 2 - Examples of calculation of amounts of SPC payable (based on figures applicable at\n    12.04.04)\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
