<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/77/0004> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable — PDF page 4\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=4).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n4. transitional provisions - see DMG Chapter 80\n\n\n5. the AIP - see DMG Chapter 83\n\n\n6. deemed weekly income from capital and capital - see DMG Chapter 84\n\n\n7. income other than earnings - see DMG Chapter 85\n\n\n8. earnings - see DMG Chapter 86.\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
