<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/77/0012> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable — PDF page 12\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=12).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nthat determination may be made even if there is not enough evidence to include these amounts.\n\n\n                                                               1 SS CS (D&A) Regs, reg 13(1); 2 reg 13(3)\n\n\n77030 The award may then be revised or superseded if further evidence is received after the claim or\n\n\nquestion has been determined1. See DMG Chapters 03 and 04 for guidance on revision and\nsupersession.\n\n\n                                                                        1 SS CS (D&A) Regs, regs 3 & 6\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
