<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0001> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 1\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=1).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nDMG Chapter 78: Additional amounts and special groups\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • General 78001 - 78024\n  • Additional amounts of guarantee credit 78025 - 78169\n  • Additional amount for housing costs 78170 - 78548\n  • Additional amount for a child or qualifying young person 78549 - 78599\n  • Special groups 78600 - 78699\n  • People in hospital 78700 - 78919\n  • Others 78920 - 78999\n  • Appendix 1 - Housing costs - amount of non-dependant deductions\n  • Appendix 2 - Housing costs - the remunerative work rule for non-dependant housing cost\n    deductions\n  • Appendix 3 - Examples of calculations for special groups\n  • Appendix 4 - Hospital cases - rates of reduction and examples of calculations\n  • Appendix 5: Housing Costs - leasehold major works\n  • Appendix 6: Transitional End Date\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
