<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0007> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 7\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=7).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nAdditional amounts of guarantee credit 78025 - 78169\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Additional amounts 78025 - 78029\n  • Additional amount for the severely disabled 78030 - 78099\n  • Additional amount for carers 78100 - 78119\n  • Additional amount for former claimants of IS, JSA(IB) and ESA(IR) 78120 - 78169\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
