<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0040> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 40\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=40).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nAdditional amount for housing costs 78170 - 78548\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Introduction 78170 - 78184\n  • Definitions 78185 - 78209\n  • Steps to follow when deciding housing costs 78210 - 78214\n  • Liability for housing costs 78215 - 78219\n  • Treated as occupying a dwelling as the home 78220 - 78269\n  • Housing costs not met 78270 - 78309\n  • Apportionment of housing costs 78310 - 78437\n  • Housing costs 78438 - 78499\n  • Persons residing with the claimant 78500 - 78529\n  • Insufficient information to determine housing costs 78530 - 78599\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
