<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0147> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 147\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=147).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n2.1 Gross                Deduction\n     weekly income\n\n\n2.2 less than £176.00    £19.65\n\n\n2.3 £176.00 to £255.99 £44.15\n\n\n2.4 £256.00 to £333.99 £62.00\n\n\n2.5 £334.00 to £444.99 £101.35\n\n\n2.6 £445.00 to £553.99 £115.45\n\n\n2.7 £554.00 or more      £126.65\n\n\n3.   any other non-dependant aged 18 or over for whom deductions are relevant - £19.65.\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
