<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0190> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 190\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=190).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n                          d.         Chimney stack repairs                                       -Yes\n\n\n                         This may include fitting roof safety rails, or roof safety harness’s,\nRoof safety                                                                                      -Yes\n                         allowing regular inspection and maintenance\n\n\n                         a. Roof insulation\n                                                                                                  Yes if not\nInsulation\n                                                                                                  provision\n                          b.         Wall insulation\n\n\n                           Cladding to the exterior of the building to prevent damage to\nBuilding frame repairs                                                                           -Yes\n                           the structure, insulates protects building from the elements\n\n\n                         This may include cleaning, painting and protective coating, or\nConcrete repairs                                                                                 -Yes\n                         repairs (including the concrete frame)\n\n\n                         a. Brickwork cleaning                                                   - Yes\n\n\nExternal walls           b. Repairs to brickwork, pointing, repairs to rendered surfaces         -Yes\n\n\n                         c. Replace wall ties                                                    -Yes\n\n\n                         a. Repairs to balcony balustrades and handrails                         -Yes\nBalconies walkways\n                         b. Repairs to common walkways and balconies                             -Yes\n\n\n                         a. Replacement                                                          -Yes\nWindows\n                         b. Replacement of single glaze with double glaze                        -Yes\n\n\n                           Repair and replacement of communal doors, ensuring\nCommunal doors                                                                                   -Yes\n                           compliance with fire regulations\n\n\n                           Carry out the redecoration to all external elements of the\nExternal redecoration      existing fabric of the building, including use of anti-graffiti paint -Yes\n                           where appropriate\n\n\n                           Carry out redecoration of all communal internal areas including\nCommunal area\n                         a. corridors and stairways, using fire retardant and/or anti-graffiti -Yes\nrepairs & decoration\n                           paint where appropriate\n\n\n                         b. Replacement of communal flooring                                     -Yes\n\n\nRainwater goods            Repair/replace guttering and down pipes                               -Yes if not\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0191> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "provision Rod and Jetting wash through all existing drainage and a. - Yes inspection chambers Drains b. Replace communal waste/soil pipes Yes if not provision c. Major repair or replacement a. Replace mains distribution board - Yes b. Repla" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
