<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0191> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 191\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=191).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n                                                                                                provision\n\n\n\n\n                         Rod and Jetting wash through all existing drainage and\n                    a.                                                                 -    Yes\n                         inspection chambers\nDrains\n\n                    b. Replace communal waste/soil pipes\n                                                                                            Yes if not\n                                                                                            provision\n                    c. Major repair or replacement\n\n\n                    a. Replace mains distribution board                                -    Yes\n\n\n                    b. Replace rising and lateral mains cables                         -    Yes\nElectrical\nInstallations            Replace bulk head lighting to communal staircases &\n                    c.\n                         balcony soffits                                                    Yes if not\n                                                                                            provision\n                    d. Replace communal corridor lighting\n\n\n                         Replace analogue aerial with digital, may include replacing\n                    a.                                                                 -    Yes\n                         cabling serving all units\nTV Aerial\n\n                    b. Installation of satellite dish to receive additional channels   No\n\n\n                    a. Maintenance and cleaning of communal shafts & flues             -    Yes\n\nVentilation\n                                                                                            Yes if not\n                    b. Replace communal extractor fans\n                                                                                            provision\n\n\n                         Installation or renewal of entry systems, which may include\n                    a.                                                                 -    Yes\nEntry Systems and        cabling and handsets in each property\nAccess\n                    b. Works to comply with Disability Discrimination Act              -    Yes\n\n\n                    All methods of damp proofing, which may include:-                  -    -\n\n\nDamp works          a. Insertion of chemical damp proof course                         -    No\n\n\n                    b. Laying a waterproof membrane on the basement floor              -    No\n\n\nRefuse/                  Replacement or repair of refuse/recycling systems and or           Yes if not\n                                                                                       -\nrecycling systems        hopper heads                                                       provision\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
