<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0193> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups  — PDF page 193\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=193).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n                        Major overhaul or replacement of communal heating systems\n                   a.                                                               - No\nCommunal                or individual elements\nHeating\n                   b. Installation of communal heating systems                      - Yes\n\n\n                                                                                        Yes if not\n                   a. Estate lighting                                               -\n                                                                                        provision\n\n\n                   b. Controlled access and security                                - Yes\n\n\n                   c. Repairs to estate roads or paths                              - Yes\nEstate works\n\n                   d. Provision and refurbishment of recreational areas             - Yes\n\n\n                   e. Landscaping                                                   - Yes\n\n\n                   f. Boundary walls and fences                                     - Yes\n\n\n                   Costs essential to the works, which may include:                 --\n\n\n                   a. Surveys                                                           Yes\n\n\n                   b. Preliminaries e.g. site set up costs                              Yes\nAssociated costs\n                   c. Fees                                                              Yes\n\n\n                   d. Access equipment e.g. scaffolding                                 Yes\n\n\n                   e. Health and safety                                                 Yes\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
