<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/79/0001> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions  — PDF page 1\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1035298c6c9802f7ed9e0/dmg-Chap-79.pdf#page=1).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nDMG Chapter 79: Payment questions\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • General rules 79000-79099\n  • Part-week payments 79100-79199\n  • Third party deductions 79200-79999\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
