<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/79/0002> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions  — PDF page 2\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1035298c6c9802f7ed9e0/dmg-Chap-79.pdf#page=2).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nGeneral rules 79000-79099\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Introduction 79000-79008\n  • When entitlement begins 79009-79049\n  • Change of circumstances 79050-79054\n  • Small amounts of SPC 79055-79099\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
