<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/79/0011> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions  — PDF page 11\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1035298c6c9802f7ed9e0/dmg-Chap-79.pdf#page=11).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nThird party deductions 79200-79999\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Introduction 79200-79299\n  • Third party deductions for housing costs 79300-79399\n  • Third party deductions for miscellaneous accommodation costs 79400-79499\n  • Third party deductions for hostel service charges 79500-79549\n  • Third party deductions for rent and service charges for fuel 79550-79589\n  • Third party deductions for fuel costs 79590-79659\n  • Third party deductions for water charges - England and Wales 79660-79699\n  • Third party deductions for water charges - Scotland 79700-79749\n  • Third party deductions for Council Tax 79750-79769\n  • Third party deductions for Community Charge 79770-79799\n  • Third party deductions for fines 79800-79939\n  • Third party deductions for eligible loan deduction scheme 79940-79984\n  • Third party deductions for integration loan scheme 79985-79999\n  • Appendix 1\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
