<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/79/0062> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions  — PDF page 62\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1035298c6c9802f7ed9e0/dmg-Chap-79.pdf#page=62).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nThird party deductions for Community Charge 79770-79799\n\n\n\nIntroduction 79770-79771\n\n\nApplication for deductions 79772-79774\n\n\nDM’s action 79775-79779\n\n\nCan a deduction be made? 79780\n\n\nAmount deducted - single debtor 79781\n\n\nAmount deducted - couples 79782-79789\n\n\nMaximum amount of deduction 79790\n\n\nOrder of priority 79791\n\n\nMore than one application 79792-79799\n\n\n\n\nIntroduction\n\n79770 LAs may request deductions for arrears of CC, where the person owing the debt is a claimant\n\nentitled to SPC1.\n\n\n                                         1 Community Charges (Deductions from IS) (No. 2) Regs 90, reg 3;\n                                       Community Charges (Deductions from IS) (Scotland) Regs 89, reg 3\n\n\n79771 Recoverable sums include any fines imposed because the person has failed to provide\ninformation in connection with registration for the charge.\n\n\n\n\nApplication for deductions\n\n79772 Recovery of the arrears can be made if the billing authority (in Scotland, levying authority) has\nobtained from a court\n\n\n1. in England and Wales, a liability order1 and\n\n\n2. in Scotland, a summary warrant or a decree2.\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/79/0063> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "1 Community Charges (Deductions from IS) (No. 2) Regs 90, reg 3(1); 2 Community Charges (Deductions from IS) (Scotland) Regs 89, reg 3(1) 79773 In Scotland the warrant or decree may include an amount for arrears of water charges. Treat thes" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
