<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/83/0001> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods — PDF page 1\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa9038ee5274a3e391e3e7c/dmgch83.pdf#page=1).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n        Chapter 83 - Assessed income\n        periods\n        Contents\n        Introduction ................................................................................................83000\n\n        Duty to specify an AIP ...............................................................................83005\n\n        Meaning of relevant decision .......................................................................83010\n\n        When is a DM prevented from setting an AIP..............................................83020\n\n        Revision........................................................................................................83025\n\n        Supersession................................................................................................83030\n\n        How long does an assessed income period last ....................................83032\n\n        AIPs of five years .........................................................................................83034\n        AIPs of an indefinite period .........................................................................83036\n        Claimants aged 80 or over with an existing award of SPC ..........................83038\n        New Claims from 6.4.16………………………………………………………….83039\n        Retirement provision is likely to change within twelve months ....................83041\n\n        Backdating ..................................................................................................83043\n\n            Backdating - when does an AIP start......................................................83047\n\n        When will an AIP end .................................................................................83050\n\n            Ending of some fixed length AIPs……………………………………………83051\n        Effect of the assessed income period......................................................83060\n\n        The assessed amount ..................................................................................83061\n        Meaning of retirement provision...................................................................83065\n\n        Meaning of overseas arrangement .............................................................83066\n\n        Meaning of occupational pension scheme ..................................................83072\n\n        Meaning of personal pension scheme .........................................................83073\n\n        Meaning of retirement annuity contract .......................................................83074\n\n        Meaning of equity release scheme ..............................................................83075\n\n        Financial Assistance Scheme ......................................................................83076\n\n        Pension Protection Fund..............................................................................83079\n\n        Deemed variations .......................................................................................83100\n\n        Circumstances in which retirement provision is deemed not to change .....83110\n\n\n\n\nVol 14 Amendment 40 June 2016\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
