<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/83/0006> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods — PDF page 6\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa9038ee5274a3e391e3e7c/dmgch83.pdf#page=6).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n             2.        a Ft T d e ci si o n t h at t h e cl ai m a nt i s e ntitl e d t o S P C a s i n D M G 8 3 0 0 7 2. .\n                                                                                                                                 1 S P C A ct 0 2, s 6( 5)\n\n             83011 -83019\n\n\n             W h e n i s a D M pr e v e nt e d fr o m s etti n g a n AI P\n\n83020        A D M c a n n ot s et a n AI P w h er e\n                                                                                                                                                    1\n             1.        t h e r el e v a nt d e ci si o n t a k e s eff e ct at a ti m e w h e n a n AI P i s alr e a d y i n f or c e or\n                                                                                                             2\n             2.        i n t h e c a s e of p art n er s, o n e p art n er i s a g e d u n d er 6 0 or\n\n             3.        S P C i s a w ar d e d, or i s a w ar d e d at a hi g h er r at e b e c a u s e a n el e m e nt of t h e\n                                                                                                                                                3\n                       cl ai m a nt’ s r etir e m e nt pr o vi si o n w hi c h i s d u e t o b e p ai d st o p s t e m p or aril y .\n                                                                         1 S P C A ct 0 2, s 6( 2); 2 S P C R e gs, r e g 1 0( 1)( a); 3 r e g 1 0( 1)( b)\n\n\n             N ot e: t hi s d o e s n ot a p pl y w h er e t h e c h a n g e o c c ur s o n, or aft er 6. 4. 1 6.\n\n             83021 -83024\n\n\n             R e vi si o n\n                                                                                                                         1\n83025        A d e ci si o n t o s et a n AI P i s a d e ci si o n u n d er a r el e v a nt e n a ct m e nt . It c a n t h er ef or e\n                                                                                                                 2\n             b e r e vi s e d i n t h e cir c u m st a n c e s pr e s cri b e d i n t h e l e gi sl ati o n .\n                                                                                                1 S S A ct 9 8, s 8( 4); 2 s 9; S S C S ( D & A) R e gs\n\n\n             Exa mp le\n\n             Mi c k m a d e a cl ai m f or S P C o n 5. 1. 1 1. W h e n m a ki n g hi s cl ai m Mi c k t ol d t h e D M t h at\n             hi s h o u s e w a s u p f or s al e a n d t h at h e h a d s a vi n g s of £ 3, 0 0 0. D e s pit e t hi s\n             i nf or m ati o n ( s e e D M G 8 3 0 4 1), t h e D M s et a n AI P f or 5 y e ar s. O n 9. 3. 1 1 Mi c k\n             i nf or m s t h e D M t h at h e h a s m o v e d a d dr e s s b e c a u s e h e h a s s ol d hi s h o u s e a n d\n             b o u g ht a fl at. H e al s o n o w h a s c a pit al of £ 2 5, 0 0 0 l eft fr o m t h e pr o c e e d s of t h e s al e\n             of t h e h o u s e aft er b u yi n g t h e fl at. W h e n l o o ki n g at t h e cir c u m st a n c e s of t h e c a s e,\n             t h e D M r e ali s e s t h at a n AI P s h o ul d n ot h a v e b e e n s et. T h e D M r e vi s e s t h e d e ci si o n\n             s etti n g a n AI P o n t h e gr o u n d s of offi ci al err or ( s e e D M G C h a pt er 0 3).\n\n             83026 -83029\n\n\n             S u p er s e s si o n\n\n83030        A d e ci si o n t o s et a n AI P m a y al s o b e s u p er s e d e d. H o w e v er t h e o nl y c h a n g e of\n             cir c u m st a n c e s t h at will b e r el e v a nt i n r el ati o n t o AI P d e ci si o n s i s t h e e n di n g of t h e\n                  1\n             AI P ( s e e D M G 8 3 0 5 0) .\n                                                                                                                     1 S S C S ( D & A) R e gs, r e g 6( 8)\n\n\n\n\n             83031\nV o l 1 4 A m e n d m e nt 4 0 J u n e 2 0 1 6\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
