<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/83/0016> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods — PDF page 16\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa9038ee5274a3e391e3e7c/dmgch83.pdf#page=16).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n             E n di n g of s o m e Fi x e d L e n gt h AI P s\n\n83051        T h o s e a w ar d s of S P C wit h a fi x e d l e n gt h AI P w hi c h i s d u e t o e n d b et w e e n 1. 4. 1 9\n                                                                                                                                      1\n             a n d 5. 4. 2 1 will b e br o u g ht t o a n e n d o n a d at e e arli er t h a n ori gi n all y i nt e n d e d .\n                                                                                                             2\n             A p p e n di x 2 d et ail s t h e d at e s o n w hi c h t h e s e AI P s will n o w e n d . A n AI P t h at e n d s i n\n             t hi s w a y d o e s n ot c arr y a ri g ht of a p p e al.\n                                                                  1 S P C A ct 0 2, s 9, 2, S P C R e gs, r e g 1 2( d); 2 S P C R e gs, S c h III A\n\n\n             83052- 83059\n\n\n\n\nV ol 1 4 A m e n d m e nt 4 0 J u n e 2 0 1 6\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
