<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/84/0037> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital — PDF page 37\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=37).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nCapital disregarded indefinitely 84357 - 84520\nAnnuities 84357\n\n\nAge-related payments 84358\n\n\nArrears of payments to certain war widows or surviving civil partners 84360\n\n\nBest Start Grants 84361 - 84364\n\n\nPayment made after Carer's Allowance reassessment following Sayce Review 84365 - 84370\n\n\nBusiness assets 84371 - 84380\n\n\nCapital which is not sterling 84381\n\n\nDeferral of retirement pension entitlement 84382 - 84383\n\n\nDeferral of state pension 84384 - 84385\n\n\nDwelling occupied as the home 84386 - 84397\n\n\nFuneral plan contract 84398 - 84400\n\n\nFuture interests in capital 84401 - 84402\n\n\nHealth in pregnancy grant 84403\n\n\nPayments in lieu of community care services or health care 84404 - 84405\n\n\nLife insurance policies 84406 - 84408\n\n\nLife interest or life rent 84409\n\n\nPayment for personal injury 84410 - 84420\n\n\nPayment to persons imprisoned or interned by the Japanese during the Second World War 84421 -\n84425\n\n\nPayment to sufferers of variant Creutzfeldt-Jakob disease and their partners 84426 - 84435\n\n\nPensions 84436 - 84440\n\n\nPersonal possessions 84441\n\n\nPremises lived in by a partner or relative 84442 - 84445\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
