<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0001> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 1\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=1).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nDMG Chapter 85: Income other than earnings\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • General 85000 - 85029\n  • Calculation of weekly income 85030 - 85051\n  • Changes in weekly income 85052 - 85090\n  • Income taken fully into account 85091 - 85199\n  • Income disregarded in part 85200 - 85279\n  • Income fully disregarded 85280 - 85399\n  • Notional income 85400 - 85999\n  • Appendix 1 - Definitions of war pensions\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
