<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0011> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 11\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=11).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nCalculation of weekly income 85030 - 85051\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • At the start of entitlement or a new assessed income period 85030 - 85051\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
