<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0018> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 18\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=18).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nChanges in weekly income 85052 - 85090\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Deemed increase to retirement pensions or annuities income other than retirement pension\n    85052 - 85057\n  • Final payments of income 85058 - 85062\n  • Treatment of arrears of income or benefits 85063 - 85090\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
