<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0027> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 27\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=27).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n5. CTC\n\n\n6. CTB\n\n\n7. DLA\n\n\n8. ESA(IR)\n\n\n9. HB\n\n\n10. IS\n\n\n11. JSA(IB)\n\n\n12. SPC\n\n\n13. SF Payments\n\n\n14. any amount included for the claimant’s exceptionally severe disablement in a WDisP or WWP\n\n15. PIP\n\n16. armed forces independence payment\n\n17. UC\n\n18. early years assistance given in accordance with section 32 of the Social Security (Scotland) Act 2018\n\n19. funeral expense assistance given in accordance with section 34 of the Social Security (Scotland) Act 2018\n\n20. maternity allowance under section 35 of the 1992 Act (state maternity allowance for employed or self-\nemployed earner)\n\n21. Scottish child payment assistance given in accordance with section 79 of the Social Security (Scotland)\nAct 2018\n\n22. assistance given in accordance with the Carer’s Assistance (Young Carer Grants) (Scotland) Regulations\n2019\n\n\n23. short-term assistance given in accordance with regulations made under section 36 of the Social Security\n(Scotland) Act 2018\n\n\n24. winter heating assistance given in accordance with regulations made under section 30 of the Social\nSecurity (Scotland) Act 2018\n\n25. disability assistance given in accordance with regulations made under section 31 of the Social Security\n(Scotland)\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
