<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0029> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 29\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=29).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nIncome taken fully into account 85091 - 85199\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Types of income taken fully into account 85091 - 85099\n  • Benefits taken fully into account 85100 - 85129\n  • Retirement pension income taken fully into account 85130 - 85169\n  • Other income taken fully into account 85170 - 85199\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
