<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0050> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 50\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=50).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nIncome disregarded in part 85200 - 85279\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Income that has a £10 disregard 85200 - 85219\n  • Income with partial disregards 85220 - 85240\n  • Other types of income partially disregarded 85241 - 85279\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
