<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0062> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 62\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=62).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n1. adds together the payments in the week £65 + £65 = £130\n\n\n2. and deducts £20 for each subtenant £40 = £90 income with £40 disregarded.\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
