<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0066> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 66\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=66).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nDisregard               £20\n\n\nIncome for SPC          £30\n\n\nThe total disregard is limited to £20 even though a discretionary payment normally has the first £20\ndisregarded.\n\n\n\n\n85251 - 85279\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
