<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0068> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 68\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=68).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nTypes of income fully disregarded 85280 - 85282\n\n\n\n85280 [See DMG Memo 11/20] [See Memo DMG 22/20] When calculating income for SPC\n\n\n1. AFIP\n\n\n2. attendance allowances\n\n\n3. BPT\n\n\n4. Best Start Grant\n\n\n5. CDI\n\n\n6. certain types of capital\n\n\n7. CHB\n\n\n8. child special allowance\n\n\n9. Christmas bonus\n\n\n10. cost of conversion of foreign money\n\n\n11. CTB\n\n\n12. discretionary trust payments\n\n\n13. DLA\n\n\n14. GA\n\n\n15. HB\n\n\n16. income frozen abroad\n\n\n17. mobility supplement\n\n\n18. payments from the Social Fund under SS legislation\n\n\n19. personal injury payments and structured settlements\n\n\n20. PIP\n\n\n21. war widows/widowers/surviving civil partners supplementary pensions\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
