<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0079> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 79\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=79).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nweeks in any period of sickness. The DM should take any payment of SSP 1 into account as earnings (see\nDMG 86033).\n\n\n                                                                  1 SPC Regs, reg 15(1)(o); reg 17A(2)(h)\n\n\n\nStatutory shared parental pay\n\n85324 Employees and workers may be entitled to shared parental leave and shared parental pay in\nrespect of babies born or adopted on or after 5.4.15. The DM should take any payment of statutory\n\nshared parental pay1 into account as earnings (see DMG 86033).\n\n\n                                                                 1 SPC Regs, reg 15(1)(qb); reg 17A(2)(ib)\n\n\n85325 - 85330\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
