<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0093> <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-explorer/ns#authority> "official-source-text; independent extraction" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0093> <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-explorer/ns#generated> _:c14n1932 <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0093> <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-explorer/ns#recordTypeLabel> "Source PDF page" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
