<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/85/0115> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings  — PDF page 115\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=115).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n2. corresponding in nature to a pension or allowance for a widow or widower under any scheme\nmentioned in section 641(1)(e) or (f) of the Income Tax (Earnings and Pensions) Act 2003.\n\n\n                                                                                               1 s 17(1)\n\n\nThe content of the examples in this document (including use of imagery) is for illustrative purposes\nonly\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
