<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0012> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 12\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=12).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nEarnings of employed earners 86028 - 86199\n\n\n\n\nSubpages\n\n  • Introduction 86028 - 86030\n  • Earnings of employed earners - explanation of terms 86031 - 86037\n  • Calculation of net earnings 86038 - 86049\n  • Treatment of particular kinds of payments from employment 86050 - 86109\n  • Earnings Disregard 86110 - 86149\n  • Payments on termination of employment 86150 - 86199\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
