<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0020> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 20\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=20).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nTreatment of particular kinds of payments from employment 86050 -\n86109\n\n\n\nIntroduction 86050 - 86053\n\n\nAccommodation provided by employer 86054\n\n\nActors and entertainers 86055 - 86057\n\n\nAdvance of earnings or loans 86058\n\n\nBonus or commission 86059\n\n\nRoyalties and copyright fees 86060 - 86062\n\n\nDirectors of limited companies 86063 - 86064\n\n\nPayments as a director or other employee 86065 - 86069\n\n\nHoliday pay 86070\n\n\nJustices of the Peace 86071 - 86075\n\n\nLocal Authority councillors 86076 - 86084\n\n\nTreatment of expenses 86085 - 86089\n\n\nPayments in lieu of remuneration 86090\n\n\nRetainers 86091\n\n\nSingle status payments 86092\n\n\nSpecial occupations 86093 - 86099\n\n\nTips 86100\n\n\nVouchers and child care cheques 86101 - 86109\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0021> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Introduction 86050 The SPC legislation1 provides some examples of what earnings can include. But there are other payments which may count as earnings. Guidance on types of earnings paid during a period of employment is in DMG 86054 - 86102." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0021> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/identifier> "page/86/0021" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
