<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0087> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPrimarySource> _:c14n3251 <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0087> <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-explorer/ns#authority> "official-source-text; independent extraction" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
