<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0088> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 88\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=88).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nAppendix 1 - Notional deductions for income tax\n\n\n\n\nMain income tax allowances\n1. The main income tax allowances are as follows.\n\n\n\n\n                      11/12   12/13   13/14   14/15   15/16   16/17   17/18   18/19 19/20 20/21 21/22\n\n\n                      £       £       £       £       £       £       £       £    £      £     £\n\n\nAdditional\n                      -       -       -       -       -       -       -       -    -      -     -\npersonal\n\n\n             under\nPersonal              7,475   8,105   9,440   10,000 10,600 11,000 11,500 11,850 12,500 12,500 12,200\n             65\n\n\nPersonal     65-74 9,940      10,500 10,500 10,500 10,600 11,000 11,500 11,850 12,500 12,500 12,500\n\n\n             75 &\nPersonal              10,090 10,660 10,660 10,660 10,660 11,000 11,500 11,850 12,500 12,500 12,500\n             over\n\n\nMarried      under\n                      -       -       -       -       -       -       -       -    -      -     -\ncouple       65\n\n\nMarried\n             65-74 -          -       -       -       -       -       -       -    -      -     -\ncouple\n\n\n             70-74\n             and\nMarried\n             born     -       -       -       -       -       -       -       -    -      -     -\ncouple\n             before\n             6.4.35\n\n\nMarried      75 &\n                      7,295   7,705   7,915   8,165   8,355   8,355   8,445 8,695 8,915\ncouple       over\n\n\n\n\nBasic rates of tax\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
