<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0093> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 93\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=93).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n                                                      Weekly £797\n\n\n                                                      Monthly £3,453\n\n\n\n\nPrimary threshold\n\n\nNo contributions are payable on weekly earnings of £149 or less or monthly earnings of £645 or less.\nOtherwise contributions are still payable at a rate of 12% for earnings between £149.01 and £797 per\nweek and at 2% for earnings above £797 per week.\n\n\n\n\n4.    Earnings Bands 14/15                                Earnings Limits 14/15\n\n\n      Earnings                     Percentage rates       LEL\n\n\n      1. up to LEL                 NIL                    weekly £111\n\n\n                                   12% of earnings that\n      2. LEL to UEL                exceed LEL up to       monthly £481\n                                   UEL\n\n\n                                                          UEL\n\n\n                                                          weekly £805\n\n\n                                                          monthly £3,488\n\n\nPrimary threshold\n\n\nNo contributions are payable on weekly earnings of £153 or less or monthly\nearnings of £663 or less. Otherwise contributions are still payable at a rate of 12%\nfor earnings between £153.01 and £805 per week and at 2% for earnings above\n£645 per week.\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
