<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0096> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 96\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=96).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\n                                 12% of earnings that\n      2. LEL to UEL                                      Monthly £503\n                                 exceed LEL up to UEL\n\n\n                                                         UEL\n\n\n                                                         Weekly £892\n\n\n                                                         Monthly £3,863\n\n\nPrimary threshold\n\n\nNo contributions are payable on weekly earnings of £162 or less or monthly earnings of £702 or less.\nOtherwise contributions are still payable at a rate of 12% for earnings between £162.01 and £892 per\nweek and at 2% for earnings above £892 per week.\n\n\n\n\n                                                                                           Earnings\n9. Earnings Bands 19/20\n                                                                                           Limits 19/20\n\n\n   Earnings                               Percentage Rates                                 LEL\n\n\n   1. Up to Primary Threshold             Nil                                              Weekly £118\n\n\n                                          12% of earnings that exceed Primary Threshold Monthly\n   2. Primary Threshold to UEL\n                                          up to UEL                                        £512\n\n\n                                                                                           UEL\n\n\n                                                                                           Weekly\n                                                                                           £962\n\n\n                                                                                           Monthly\n                                                                                           £4,167\n\n\n   Primary Threshold\n                                          Otherwise contributions are still payable at a\n   No contributions are payable on        rate of 12% for earnings between £166.01 and\n   weekly earnings of £166 per week or £962 per week and at 2% for earnings above\n   less or monthly earnings of £719 or    £962 per week.\n   less.\n\n\n10. Earnings Bands 20/21                                                            Earnings Limits\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
