<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0098> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 98\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=98).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nClass 2 contributions\n\n\n\n12.\n\n\n                    13/14      14/15 15/16 16/17 17/18 18/19 19/20                           20/21           21/22\n\n\n                    £          £       £       £           £          £      £               £               £\n\n\nOrdinary Class 2\n                    2.70       2.75    2.80    2.80        2.85       2.95   3.00            3.05            3.05\nrate\n\n\nShare fisherman\n                    3.35       3.40    3.40    3.45        3.50       3.60   3.65            3.70            3.70\nrate\n\n\n\n\nSmall earnings exception/small profits threshold\n\n\n\n13.\n\n\n                13/14 14/15 15/16 16/17 17/18 18/19 19/20                                    20/21           21/22\n\n\n                £          £       £       £           £          £          £               £               £\n\n\nEarnings limit 5,725 5,885 5,965 5,965 6,025 6,205 6,365                                     6,475           6,515\n\n\n\n\nClass 4 contributions\n\n\n\n13.\n\n\n            13/14          14/15       15/16       16/17          17/18          18/19   19/20       20/21       21/22\n\n\n            £              £           £           £              £              £       £           £           £\n\n\nLower level 7,755          7,956       8,060       8,060          8,164          8,424   8,632       9,500       9,568\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
