<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/86/0099> <https://schema.org/text> "# DMG Vol 14 Ch 86: Earnings  — PDF page 99\n\n[Verify the official PDF page](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=99).\n\n> Extracted source text. Layout and reading order may differ from the PDF. This project does not establish current entitlement or law.\n\n```text\nHigher level 41,450    41,865   42,358     43,000      45,000      46,350    50,000      50,000    50,270\n\n\n                                                                                                   9% of\n             9% of     9% of    9% of      9% of                   9% of\n                                                       9% of                             9% of     £9,568\n             £7,755    £7,956   £8,060 £8,060                      £8,424    9% of\n                                                       £8,164 to                         £9,500    to\n             to        to       to         to                      to        £8,632 to\n                                                       £45,000                           to        £50,270\nPercentage £41,450 £41,865 £42,358 £43,000                         £46,350 £50,000\n                                                       per year,                         £50,000 per year,\nrate         per year, per year, per year, per year,               per year, per year,\n                                                       2%                                per year, 2% above\n             2%        2%       2%         2%                      2%        2% above\n                                                       above                             2% above £50,270\n             above     above    above      above                   above     £50,000\n                                                       £45,000                           £50,000\n             £41,450 £41,865 £42,358 £43,000                       £46,350\n\n\n\n\nThe content of the examples in this document (including use of imagery) is for illustrative purposes\nonly\n\n```\n" <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
