<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc002> <https://schema.org/text> "# Where are earnings and other income distinguished?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nCompare chapter 85, PDF page 4 with chapter 86, PDF pages 2–4. Locate categories and evidence; do not classify an individual claimant’s income automatically.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings , PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/690b7db588a98da87e292365/dmg-ch-85.pdf#page=4).\n\nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos. Source SHA-256: `fe6fe79a4ff52271d6edf97af6b01ebd4290867b30d6288c38eb5e3a6d613c74`.\n\nComparison source: [chapter 86, PDF page 2](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=2).\n\nComparison source: [chapter 86, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=3).\n\nComparison source: [chapter 86, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/698462dd468d351e1406b4a7/dmgch86.pdf#page=4).\n\n\n[Research reference: Distinguish income topics](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/income-map.md).\n\n[Research reference: Earnings](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/earnings.md).\n\n[Research reference: Income other than earnings](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/income-other-than-earnings.md).\n\n[Research reference: DMG Vol 14 Ch 85: Income other than earnings ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/85.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 85 — PDF page 4](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/85/0004.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 86 — PDF page 2](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/86/0002.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 86 — PDF page 3](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/86/0003.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 86 — PDF page 4](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/86/0004.md)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
