<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc003> <https://schema.org/text> "# What historical context matters for assessed income periods?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nStart at chapter 83, PDF page 3 and inspect its dated note. Several pages have poor text extraction. Open the original PDF when search appears incomplete.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5aa9038ee5274a3e391e3e7c/dmgch83.pdf#page=3).\n\nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos. Source SHA-256: `b7b36dae645ea1886638833a099c6eccf6a2f1312c1e2708fa1de7bd8a63e43e`.\n\n\n[Research reference: Spot historical and missing context](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/context-review.md).\n\n[Research reference: Assessed income period](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/assessed-income-period.md).\n\n[Research reference: DMG Vol 14 Ch 83: Assessed income periods](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/83.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 83 — PDF page 3](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/83/0003.md)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
