<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc004> <https://schema.org/text> "# Where can an adviser examine mixed-age couple guidance?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nStart at chapter 77, PDF page 26 and read the continuation and source references. Do not decide a couple’s eligibility from a heading or a single page.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable, PDF page 26](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=26).\n\nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos. Source SHA-256: `0528f2fb95ac3bd71bdff0d91cdaba5df76ab4260396ca99608c840004ff5708`.\n\n\n[Research reference: Spot historical and missing context](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/context-review.md).\n\n[Research reference: Mixed-age couples](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/mixed-age-couples.md).\n\n[Research reference: DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/77.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 77 — PDF page 26](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/77/0026.md)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
