<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc005> <https://schema.org/text> "# Where are carer-related additional amounts discussed?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nStart at chapter 78, PDF page 27. Cross-referenced memos require separate currentness checks; the bundle does not infer their contents.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups , PDF page 27](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e10327f5069cdc54868955/dmg-Ch-78.pdf#page=27).\n\nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos. Source SHA-256: `d5e17de1d343fc6a6498089897b222a4989914fa53f85af9ddc8c9c05471e2b8`.\n\n\n[Research reference: Find capital guidance](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/capital-review.md).\n\n[Research reference: Carers](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/carers.md).\n\n[Research reference: DMG Vol 13 Ch 78: State Pension Credit: additional amounts and special groups ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/78.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 78 — PDF page 27](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/78/0027.md)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
