<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc006> <https://schema.org/text> "# Where does the guide cover part-week payments?\n\nIndependent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.\n\nRead chapter 79, PDF pages 8–9 together. The definition and subsequent conditions span pages, showing why neighbouring-page navigation matters.\n\nSource: [DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions , PDF page 8](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e1035298c6c9802f7ed9e0/dmg-Chap-79.pdf#page=8).\n\nInspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos. Source SHA-256: `0098a2267cb9b321cae6bf25b3493b3674c4e8cb1b859fcd6b8ae7d459323be8`.\n\n\n[Research reference: Distinguish income topics](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/income-map.md).\n\n[Research reference: Part-week payments](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/part-week-payments.md).\n\n[Research reference: DMG Vol 13 Ch 79: Payment questions ](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/79.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 79 — PDF page 8](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/79/0008.md)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
