<https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/question/pc008> <https://schema.org/text> "# Can this bundle tell me what I am entitled to?\n\nIndependent project-authored statement of scope.\n\nNo. This exemplar supports source discovery and inspection. It does not evaluate individual facts, provide current legal consolidation, calculate an award or replace qualified advice. No personal claimant data is needed for the demonstration.\n\nSource: [project notice](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/NOTICE.md). DWP chapter 77 is background guidance, not evidence for the capabilities or privacy of this project.\n\n\n[Research reference: Spot historical and missing context](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/story/context-review.md).\n\n[Research reference: State Pension Credit](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/term/pension-credit.md).\n\n[Research reference: DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/chapter/77.md).\n\n[Research reference: Chapter 77 — PDF page 3](https://github.com/chris-page-gov/okf-dwp/blob/main/bundle/records/page/77/0003.md)." <https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/bundle/pension-credit> .
